license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/tyasird/pFLEX"
abstract: >-
  pflex is a benchmarking toolkit for evaluating CRISPR screen results against
  biological functional standards. The toolkit computes gene-level and
  module-level performance metrics, helping researchers systematically assess
  the biological relevance and resolution of their CRISPR screening data.
keywords:
  - genetic networks
  - precision-recall
  - CRISPR screens
  - benchmarking
